---

## 📊 SQL Query Levels

### 🔹 Level 1: Basic Queries

* Display all students
* Select specific columns
* View all courses
* Filter by city
* Filter by join year

### 🔹 Level 2: Filtering

* Filter by gender
* Marks greater than a value
* Department based filtering
* Exclude specific city
* Range filtering using BETWEEN

### 🔹 Level 3: Sorting

* Sort student names
* Sort marks descending
* Sort by join year

### 🔹 Level 4: Aggregate Analysis

* Total number of students
* Average marks
* Highest marks
* Lowest marks
* Total marks

